#. TRANSLATORS Invisible group label (for screen readers) of the row of tabs on the administration page: Settings, Tours, Statistics, Support (src/admin/AdminApp.vue:10)
msgid "Settings section"
msgstr "Einstellungsbereich"

#. TRANSLATORS: Placeholder of the list of languages to translate into
